    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Orientation for the inaugural class of undergraduate medicine and nursing students in Kenya kicked off with pomp and colour. The class of 121 students - 60 for Bachelor of Science in Nursing (BSc Nursing) - Direct Entry and 61 for Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (MBChB) - had a chance to interact and learn about AKU.",
